  37:Drivers/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_i2c_ex.c ****   ==============================================================================
  38:Drivers/STM32F3xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32f3xx_hal_i2c_ex.c ****   [..] This driver provides functions to configure Noise Filter and Wake Up Feature
